@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-03 Manage Products

|Customer|
start
:Customer selects "Products" on the Home Page;

|System|
:Retrieve and display the current product catalog;

|Customer|
:Select a specific product to view its full details;

|System|
:Display product details (price breakdown, size options, ingredients, allergen info)[cite: 1];

if (Customer wants to customize the selected product?) then (Yes)
  :Start Manage Cake Design use case[cite: 1];
else (No)
  :Continue browsing the catalog[cite: 1];
endif

|Staff/Admin|
:Select "Manage Products" from the Admin Panel Dashboard[cite: 1];

|System|
:Display the Manage Products page with all current products[cite: 1];

|Staff/Admin|
:Choose Add New Product, or select an existing product to edit or remove[cite: 1];

|System|
:Display blank form for add, or pre-filled form for edit[cite: 1];

|Staff/Admin|
:Enter or update the product details and click Save or confirm Remove[cite: 1];

|System|
:Validate required fields and formatting[cite: 1];

if (Information valid and complete?) then (Yes)
  if (Product update conflicts with an active order?) then (Yes)
    |System|
    :Warn Staff/Admin before saving change[cite: 1];
    
    |Staff/Admin|
    if (Staff/Admin confirms save?) then (Yes)
      |System|
      :Save the product record[cite: 1];
    else (No)
      :Cancel the update[cite: 1];
    endif
  else (No)
    |System|
    :Save the product record to the database[cite: 1];
  endif
  
  |System|
  :Refresh the live catalog[cite: 1];
  :Display confirmation message[cite: 1];
else (No)
  |System|
  :Prompt for missing or corrected fields[cite: 1];
  :Do not save the record[cite: 1];
endif

|System|
stop
@enduml
